urança, ideal para quem valoriza mobilidade e qualidade de vida sem abrir mão da exclusividade.\n\nAgende sua visita e descubra um apartamento único, com espaços generosos. Seu novo endereço com muito estilo espera por você.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1f4ac1caa5807f53f248e5/pilar-homes-images-watermark/857234d3-172e-4d9d-acec-c923c17dea3a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1f4ac1caa5807f53f248e5/pilar-homes-images-watermark/44a6380e-619a-4bce-b8fc-9f351c034b39.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1f4ac1caa5807f53f248e5/pilar-homes-images-watermark/be3243d2-0983-4870-b57f-0fcc4a290237.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1f4ac1caa5807f53f248e5/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b1c6932a-76d2-4647-8ea0-901021d18148.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1f4ac1caa5807f53f248e5/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f0fe105c-6686-4846-b738-1621294a4826.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1f4ac1caa5807f53f248e5/pilar-homes-images-watermark/70a485d6-8298-4729-a866-b8be7c95b7b0.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1f4ac1caa5807f53f248e5/pilar-homes-images-watermark/6e025298-2158-499f-852f-1115d8b67d6f.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1f4ac1caa5807f53f248e5/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f2451a9f-8673-4b39-865c-176d3233b929.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1f4ac1caa5807f53f248e5/pilar-homes-images-watermark/94989972-e6dc-445d-8597-c523f40ecebf.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1f4ac1caa5807f53f248e5/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f586e2de-ffcb-4382-a002-87306a958b1b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1f4ac1caa5807f53f248e5/pilar-homes-images-watermark/052551f4-c5cf-4b55-b2a5-b4ab8b647397.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1f4ac1caa5807f53f248e5/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1daaae0f-9fda-46f5-a